  - m_Id: 5782593593476
    m_Localized: All right, I am going...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593477
    m_Localized: Oh no, I need a quick break!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593478
    m_Localized: What a crowd! Back to work!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593479
    m_Localized: My throat is dry...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593480
    m_Localized: While nobody is here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593481
    m_Localized: I have no workstation...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593482
    m_Localized: What should I do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593483
    m_Localized: Heading home...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5782593593484
    m_Localized: Have you heard the news?
